WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750
Lily blocks Ryu’s recorded OD Shoryuken.

2
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.500
Standing heavy punch punishes the reversal recovery.

3
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.450
Forward heavy punch continues the punish.

4
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.350
Wind-enhanced medium Condor Spire launches the Super pickup.

5
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:08.850
Breezing Hawk activates from the wind-Spire juggle.

6
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.350
Ryu falls after the one-stock Super finish.
